  partName: Intake Manifold Insulator Plate
  description: The Intake Manifold Insulator Plate is a tiny, thin-flat component
    positioned at the middle-center-front of the engine, insulating the intake manifold
    from excessive heat generated by the engine. Made of Material.006, this plate
    plays a crucial role in maintaining the engine's overall temperature and performance.
    Notably, the Intake Manifold Insulator Plate works in conjunction with the intake
    manifold gaskets to provide a comprehensive seal and insulation system for the
    intake manifold.
